      children: [(0,jsx_runtime.jsx)(_components.strong, {
        children: "Osho Darshan:"
      }), " The disciple's gratitude is honest: he has heard, and the hearing was real. Osho says hearing is the first door of the temple — shravana, the listening that is not mere noise but reception. Arjuna has listened so deeply that the words have begun to change his chemistry. And yet the ear is still a window, not a wall removed. The next sentence will ask for the door itself. The Gita never belittles what the disciple has; it always invites him to the more that stands before him."]
